WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:04.110
This is Nuits Receipts, a receipt inbox you deploy yourself.

00:04.700 --> 00:08.900
It's open source, and it runs on Cloudflare Workers, in your own account.

00:09.500 --> 00:13.290
Forward a receipt by email, or upload a PDF or a photo.

00:13.900 --> 00:19.490
It reads the vendor, the amounts, the VAT and the date, and it flags anything it's unsure about.

00:20.050 --> 00:22.700
Import your bank statement as a CSV,

00:22.700 --> 00:25.660
or map any other layout, and add more than one account.

00:26.230 --> 00:31.150
Each payment is matched to a receipt, and the missing ones are listed, so you know what to chase.

00:31.710 --> 00:36.100
When the month is done, it prepares a ZIP and a CSV for your accountant.

00:36.620 --> 00:37.880
Check it before you send it.

00:38.450 --> 00:42.160
AI usage is about fifteen cents a month at two hundred receipts.

00:42.720 --> 00:46.440
Reading PDFs needs Workers Paid, at five dollars a month.

00:47.100 --> 00:50.210
The code is on GitHub, under Apache 2.0.
